# Favorite companies: one careers-page URL per line. Lines starting with # are ignored;
# inline ` # comment` after a URL is also ignored.
#
# SETUP: copy this file to favorites.txt and replace the examples with 15-30 companies
# YOU want to work at. Direct Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby board URLs render most reliably:
#   https://boards.greenhouse.io/<company>
#   https://jobs.lever.co/<company>
#   https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/<company>
# Generic /careers pages also work but some JS-heavy ones fail to render (the scan
# skips failures and reports them in the digest).
#
# How to build your list: check where people 1-2 levels above you work, browse the
# YC jobs directory, and layoffs.fyi's "still hiring" page. The weekly
# /discover-startups run will also append companies automatically over time.
https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/postman
https://boards.greenhouse.io/stripe
https://jobs.lever.co/figma
